WEBVTT

00:01.751 --> 00:04.671
<b>Why are we forced to work?!</b>

00:04.671 --> 00:07.921
<b>Why must we pay money in order to eat?!</b>

00:07.921 --> 00:10.051
<b>Can't we all just share?</b>

00:10.051 --> 00:13.261
<b>The rich get fat while the poor die!</b>

00:13.641 --> 00:16.641
<b>Where is the true freedom in this world?!{*tlc is this okay}{meaning-wise, yes. but isn't it too short?}</b>

00:16.641 --> 00:19.311
<b>We are all slaves to our work!</b>

00:19.311 --> 00:21.101
<b>And is work fun?</b>

00:21.601 --> 00:23.941
<b>No! How could it be?!</b>

00:23.941 --> 00:26.941
<b>We do not want to work, period!</b>

00:26.941 --> 00:30.611
<b>That's why I, Hammerhead, will change our society</b>

00:30.611 --> 00:34.701
<b>into one where only those who want to work will work, supporting those who don't!</b>

00:35.161 --> 00:37.581
<b>We will create a utopia!</b>

00:37.581 --> 00:41.371
<b>The Paradisers, led by me, Hammerhead, will make all this a reality!</b>

00:46.581 --> 00:48.381
<b>Boss, no one's listening.</b>

00:48.381 --> 00:49.591
<b>What?!</b>

00:50.001 --> 00:52.591
<b>Bah! They're all mindless damn sheep!{wake up, this beats "plebs" any day}</b>

00:52.591 --> 00:54.011
<b>Let's go!</b>

00:54.011 --> 00:57.601
<b>Zeniru's the richest man in town. We'll wreck his posh penthouse</b>

00:57.601 --> 00:59.891
<b>and show them we're serious!</b>

00:59.891 --> 01:02.771
<b>High-rise apartments are symbols of inequality!</b>

01:02.771 --> 01:04.141
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

