<b>Target destroyed!</b>

03:06.931 --> 03:10.351
<b>These experimental battle suits sure pack a wallop.</b>

03:10.351 --> 03:14.651
<b>It was totally{well} worth risking our lives to steal them{ from that organization}.</b>

03:14.651 --> 03:16.981
<b>Wait, that was the wrong building.</b>

03:18.151 --> 03:19.571
<b>My bad, Boss.</b>

03:19.571 --> 03:21.781
<b>Zeniru's house is a little further up.</b>

03:23.161 --> 03:25.491
<b>Everyone makes mistakes!</b>

03:25.491 --> 03:28.911
<b>The important thing is to 
learn from them. Am I right?</b>

03:29.201 --> 03:30.161
<b>Absolutely, sir{you're right}!</b>

03:30.161 --> 03:33.041
<b>All right, then onward to Zeniru's!</b>

03:46.591 --> 03:49.221
<b>Thanks, bicycle guy!</b>

04:10.871 --> 04:14.961
<b>Don't come asking to play rock-paper-scissors with a booger on your finger!</b>

04:18.841 --> 04:19.711
<b>A dream?</b>

04:21.091 --> 04:25.381
<b><i>The terrorist group responsible for the destruction 
call themselves the "Paradisers."{*tlc. do terrorist groups riot? more like attack right? turmoil purhaps?}{not riot. wreaking havoc. destruction. violence}</i></b>

04:25.381 --> 04:27.931
<b><i>They have destroyed a high-rise building in City F.</i></b>

04:27.931 --> 04:30.721
<b><i>The situation seems to be spiraling out of control.</i></b>

04:31.101 --> 04:34.731
<b><i>We have just learned the identity of their leader.</i></b>

04:34.731 --> 04:40.731
B-class Criminal Hammerhead

04:34.731 --> 04:40.731
B-class Criminal Hammerhead

04:35.311 --> 04:37.981
<b><i>Hammerhead is a B-class criminal</i></b>

04:37.981 --> 04:40.731
<b><i>who has been involved in several violent incidents in the past.</i></b>

04:41.571 --> 04:43.941
<b><i>He is a man of large stature,</i></b>

04:43.941 --> 04:46.491
<b><i>standing 2.15 meters tall 
and weighing 210 kilos.</i></b>

04:46.491 --> 04:52.991
<b><i>According to one report, he once fought 20 men 
in a street brawl and sent them all to the hospital.</i></b>

04:53.911 --> 04:57.791
<b><i>The Paradisers sent the following statement to this TV station.</i></b>

04:57.791 --> 04:59.131
<b><i>"We will continue our rampage</i></b>

04:59.131 --> 05:03.381
<b><i>until food, clothing, and shelter are provided free of charge to those who do not work,"{*split pls Hyaku}</i></b>

05:03.381 --> 05:05.171
<b><i>Sounds pretty boring.</i></b>

05:03.381 --> 05:06.091
<b><i>amongst other nonsensical{unintelligible} demands.</i></b>

05:06.091 --> 05:12.681
<b><i>Like Hammerhead, the group is made up of unemployed young men with no motivation to work.</i></b>

05:08.971 --> 05:11.261
<b><i>No need for me to get involved.</i></b>

05:12.681 --> 05:16.351
<b><i>In addition, the group members 
all have bald heads,{i'm no translation checker, but 1) they're saying "skinhead" 2) saitama doesn't shave, he's just bald normally 3) shaven is an attribute, but not a visual one, the appearance is that of a *bald* head}</i></b>

05:16.351 --> 05:18.481
<b><i>making them quite intimidating.</i></b>

05:19.401 --> 05:22.571
<b><i>Anyone who encounters any 
bald-headed men on the street</i></b>

05:22.571 --> 05:24.991
<b><i>is advised to leave the area immediately.</i></b>

05:25.691 --> 05:27.491
<b>Wh-What?</b>

05:28.451 --> 05:28.991
<b><i>But that's—</i></b>

05:29.281 --> 05:29.861
<b><i>They stole</i></b>

05:30.281 --> 05:31.991
<b><i>my look!</i></b>

05:32.451 --> 05:33.871
<b><i>I spend all this time trying to be a hero,</i></b>

05:34.451 --> 05:38.001
<b><i>but if this goes on,{they keep acting up} I'll be treated like a villain!</i></b>

05:39.541 --> 05:41.381
<b>I'm gonna smash them!</b>

05:42.791 --> 05:43.671
<b>Run!</b>

05:43.671 --> 05:44.211
<b>It's them!</b>

05:44.211 --> 05:46.421
<b>The Paradisers are coming!</b>

05:47.341 --> 05:50.051
<b>They… aren't backing down!{ellipsis is justified but its placement is tricky to figure out}</b>

05:52.601 --> 05:54.221
<b>This is too dangerous!</b>

05:56.721 --> 05:58.601
<b>Stop right there, you pack of thugs!</b>

06:10.991 --> 06:14.491
<b>The righteous cyclist, Mumen Rider, is here!</b>

06:14.491 --> 06:16.741
<b>Mumen Rider has come to save us!</b>

06:16.741 --> 06:18.201
<b>There's nothing to fear if he's here!</b>

06:20.291 --> 06:22.081
<b>A hero? What a joke!</b>

06:22.921 --> 06:23.711
<b>Here I go!{eh}</b>

06:26.961 --> 06:29.381
<b>Somebody call an ambulance!</b>

06:30.421 --> 06:32.261
<b>Mr. Zeniru, you must flee!</b>

06:33.721 --> 06:39.181
<b>Running away from terrorists would hurt my reputation.</b>

06:39.181 --> 06:40.981
<b>There's no need to leave.</b>

06:43.401 --> 06:45.361
<b>You're a lucky man.</b>

06:45.361 --> 06:49.401
<b>Just be glad I'm still under contract.{having this occur while I'm still under contract.}</b>

06:50.531 --> 06:52.491
<b>But you're a bodyguard—</b>

06:52.491 --> 06:53.661
<b>Oh, Sonic!</b>

06:54.121 --> 06:56.041
<b>Can I leave this to you?</b>

06:56.451 --> 06:57.701
<b>{The men coming are}Those guys are—</b>

06:58.621 --> 06:59.871
<b>Of course.</b>

07:00.751 --> 07:03.121
<b>It's <i>their</i> lives you should worry about.</b>

07:03.121 --> 07:07.711
<b>Please do think of a way to 
dispose of the pile of corpses{dead bodies}.</b>

07:09.011 --> 07:10.261
<b><i>The Paradisers…{the last line makes me almost certain all four of these are internal monologue}</i></b>

07:10.261 --> 07:14.471
<b><i>A bunch of upstarts equipped with 
some new type of battle suit.</i></b>

07:14.971 --> 07:17.811
<b><i>And the B-class criminal Hammerhead.</i></b>

07:17.811 --> 07:20.431
<b><i>He might have some backbone.</i></b>

07:20.431 --> 07:24.941
THE MODERN NINJA

07:20.431 --> 07:24.941
THE MODERN NINJA

07:26.941 --> 07:31.781
<b>Boss, you can see Zeniru's building across the woods.</b>

07:31.781 --> 07:34.661
<b>People call it the Golden Turd.</b>

07:36.411 --> 07:37.701
<b>All right, let's go!</b>

07:45.881 --> 07:47.331
<b>We've got company.{Something's here.}</b>

07:48.751 --> 07:50.971
<b>I've been waiting for you, Hammerhead.</b>

07:52.761 --> 07:54.641
<b>Zeniru sent me.</b>

07:57.301 --> 07:59.011
<b>Let me start by saying</b>

07:59.561 --> 08:04.021
<b>no opponent of mine has ever escaped alive.</b>

08:04.021 --> 08:05.691
<b>I plan on keeping it that way.</b>

08:05.691 --> 08:08.811
<b>When it comes to my work{job}, I'm a perfectionist.</b>

08:08.811 --> 08:12.241
<b>But if you surrender right now, I'll let you live.</b>

08:13.111 --> 08:15.151
<b>So, what will it be?</b>

08:45.231 --> 08:46.311
<b><i>What is this?</i></b>

08:49.611 --> 08:51.191
<b><i>What's going on?</i></b>

08:51.191 --> 08:51.981
<b>Why is every—</b>

08:56.781 --> 08:58.571
<b><i>{Sh-Shit!}{ugh I don't like this}Holy crap!{I don't like this either}</i></b>

09:00.701 --> 09:03.121
<b>Bastard!</b>

09:10.211 --> 09:13.341
<b>What's this now? Trying to intimidate me?</b>

09:13.961 --> 09:16.181
<b>You can't see me, can you?</b>

09:17.051 --> 09:18.891
<b>There you are!</b>

09:23.181 --> 09:24.471
<b>It's a terrorist!</b>

09:24.471 --> 09:25.771
<b>I'm not one of them!</b>

09:32.151 --> 09:34.691
<b><i>So he decided to fight rather than flee.</i></b>

09:43.871 --> 09:46.961
<b><i>Oops, there goes my bad habit again.</i></b>

09:48.501 --> 09:50.961
<b>You're just a little dog bought by Zeniru's money.</b>

09:50.961 --> 09:57.091
<b>You think a freedom fighter like me{someone like me, who fights for a noble cause,} 
can lose to a hired dog like you?!</b>

09:57.091 --> 09:59.881
<b><i>{Yes, }I see what he's up to.</i></b>

09:59.881 --> 10:02.101
<b><i>Just as I thought—he's a complete fool.</i></b>

10:02.101 --> 10:06.101
<b><i>Couldn't he have at least tried to 
arrange the rocks in a less obvious way?</i></b>

10:08.521 --> 10:10.771
<b>There are plenty more rocks where those came from!</b>

10:11.351 --> 10:15.231
<b>If you don't stop me, they'll keep coming!</b>

10:15.231 --> 10:20.531
<b>So you think you'll be able to deal with my speed if you know which direction I'm coming from?</b>

10:21.031 --> 10:23.531
<b>How pathetic. But I'll play along.</b>

10:23.821 --> 10:25.041
<b><i>In fact,</i></b>

10:25.041 --> 10:26.491
<b><i>I'll take you…</i></b>

10:27.121 --> 10:28.001
<b><i>straight on!</i></b>

10:34.671 --> 10:36.671
<b><i>He's too fast. I can't see him.</i></b>

10:36.671 --> 10:38.551
<b><i>But that doesn't matter…{it doesn't matter if I can't}</i></b>

10:38.551 --> 10:39.721
<b><i>if I do this!{Because of this!}</i></b>

10:42.681 --> 10:43.851
<b>Gotcha!</b>

10:46.391 --> 10:50.811
<b>Reflect on how stupid you were to 
challenge me {face off against me }on your way down to Hell!</b>

10:55.561 --> 10:56.941
<b>It's over.</b>

10:56.941 --> 10:59.611
<b>Unfortunately, I couldn't go easy on them.</b>

11:00.611 --> 11:04.071
<b>Yes, Hammerhead's body is here too.</b>

11:04.071 --> 11:05.411
<b>I'll head back now—</b>

11:07.531 --> 11:09.201
<b><i>The body disappeared?</i></b>

11:12.921 --> 11:14.711
<b><i>That was close!</i></b>

11:14.711 --> 11:17.421
<b><i>Good thing he hit my head.</i></b>

11:17.421 --> 11:22.221
<b><i>My skull's always been thicker than the average human's.{you can say that again}</i></b>

11:22.221 --> 11:26.351
<b><i>Dammit! I don't know who that son of a bitch{motherforker} was, 
but one day I'm gonna kill—</i></b>

11:26.351 --> 11:26.851
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

11:27.431 --> 11:29.471
<b><i>Now what?</i></b>

11:37.861 --> 11:39.271
<b>Oh, there you are.</b>

11:52.541 --> 11:54.081
<b>As with the mosquito monster,{it might be nice to put a fade here but it doesn't seem to quite work}</b>

11:54.711 --> 11:59.051
<b>I once again underestimated my opponent's power.{it's over genos, I have the high ground}</b>

11:59.591 --> 12:03.171
<b>I let my guard down, 
and Kabuto took advantage of that.</b>

12:03.171 --> 12:05.921
<b>If Master Saitama had not been there,</b>

12:06.591 --> 12:08.891
<b>I would have certainly been destroyed.</b>

12:09.551 --> 12:10.431
<b>I see.</b>

12:10.891 --> 12:12.641
<b>Well, I'm glad you're okay.{aaaargh this is hard, he got interrupted at *exactly the end of his sentence*}</b>

12:12.641 --> 12:13.971
<b>Doctor…</b>

12:13.971 --> 12:16.691
<b>Master Saitama saved my life twice.</b>

12:17.561 --> 12:20.401
<b>You, Doctor Kuseno, restored my life to me.</b>

12:20.401 --> 12:23.201
<b>Later, Master Saitama saved that same life{this same life was saved by Master Saitama},</b>

12:23.201 --> 12:25.401
<b>and now he has saved it again.</b>

12:26.361 --> 12:28.701
<b>Yes, I get the picture, Genos.</b>

12:29.531 --> 12:34.501
<b>Basically, you're trying to tell me how amazing this Saitama fellow is, right?</b>

12:34.501 --> 12:35.461
<b>Yes.</b>

12:36.001 --> 12:39.171
<b>Genos, they're not ready just yet,</b>

12:39.171 --> 12:42.461
<b>but I'm developing a new series of augmentations.</b>

12:42.461 --> 12:47.471
<b>When I replace your existing parts with these 
new ones, you may be able to surpass this Saitama.</b>

12:48.801 --> 12:54.641
<b>I imagine he must possess an enormous amount of 
strength for you to go on about him like this.</b>

12:56.601 --> 12:57.231
<b>Yes.</b>

12:58.311 --> 12:59.771
<b>What's your deal?</b>

12:59.771 --> 13:01.981
<b>You here to sign up with the Paradisers?</b>

13:01.981 --> 13:02.481
<b>No, no.</b>

13:03.361 --> 13:05.781
<b>I'm just a guy who's a hero for fun.</b>

13:06.241 --> 13:09.241
<b>For personal reasons, 
I'm here to smash your heads in.</b>

13:10.321 --> 13:12.201
<b>So, where are your followers?</b>

13:12.201 --> 13:14.161
<b>Then, die!</b>

13:21.291 --> 13:23.751
<b>I better get out of here quick.</b>

13:25.551 --> 13:27.381
<b><i>H-Huh?!</i></b>

13:27.381 --> 13:29.221
<b><i>I thought I punched him…</i></b>

13:29.881 --> 13:31.761
<b>What a letdown.</b>

13:31.761 --> 13:34.891
<b>Those battle suits had me all excited.{I was all excited about these battle suits.}</b>

13:35.391 --> 13:38.931
<b>But they look lame, and all they do is give you superhuman strength.</b>

13:42.601 --> 13:46.531
<b>You have no idea how hard it was 
to get ahold of these things!</b>

13:46.531 --> 13:50.621
<b>How could you know what they're worth?!{*tlc is he talking about their value as in $ or whether the suit is any good or not}{"worth" can mean both right? then it's ok}</b>

13:52.911 --> 13:58.661
<b>I've been looking for someone to 
test this suit's full power{the full power of this suit} on!</b>

14:06.421 --> 14:09.341
<b>Spin Attack!</b>

14:10.221 --> 14:14.101
<b><i>I used to use that move 
all the time when I was a kid.</i></b>

14:17.261 --> 14:19.641
<b>No way…</b>

14:21.601 --> 14:25.441
<b><i>Hammerhead, huh? He's a lot like me.</i></b>

14:25.901 --> 14:28.951
<b>What the hell are you?!</b>

14:37.411 --> 14:42.421
<b>W-Wait! I just wanted to get out of working!</b>

14:45.251 --> 14:47.001
<b>Don't be bad anymore, okay?</b>

14:47.001 --> 14:50.301
<b>Huh? So you're not going to kill me?</b>

14:50.301 --> 14:50.961
<b>Get outta here.</b>

14:50.961 --> 14:52.181
<b>Y-Yes, sir!{O-Okay!}{Y-Yessir!}</b>

14:59.811 --> 15:01.851
<b>Guess I'll head{go} home.</b>

15:03.981 --> 15:06.271
<b>Where did Hammerhead go?</b>

15:09.021 --> 15:11.071
<b>There's no one left but you.</b>

15:20.081 --> 15:22.921
<b>Hammerhead went that way. Butt naked.</b>

15:26.961 --> 15:28.091
<b>What's this?</b>

15:34.221 --> 15:35.551
<b>Hey, you've got it wrong.</b>

15:37.221 --> 15:38.681
<b>I've got what wrong?</b>

15:39.561 --> 15:41.941
<b>I'm not one of the Paradisers.</b>

15:43.141 --> 15:44.311
<b>You're lying.</b>

15:44.601 --> 15:45.771
<b>No, no, no.</b>

15:45.771 --> 15:47.941
<b>Don't be dumb! Look at me!{*split please Hyaku. Nonono by itself}</b>

15:47.941 --> 15:48.941
<b>I don't need to.</b>

15:49.611 --> 15:52.231
<b>That bald head is all the proof I need.{With that bald head, there's no denying it.}</b>

15:52.821 --> 15:53.361
<b>No…</b>

15:53.781 --> 15:55.571
<b>Look! It's me! Me!</b>

15:55.571 --> 15:57.821
<b>You know, the guy who's a hero for fun—</b>

15:57.821 --> 15:58.831
<b>Never heard of you.</b>

16:03.581 --> 16:05.211
<b>Oh, I see…</b>

16:05.211 --> 16:08.051
<b>Either way, it doesn't matter.</b>

16:08.961 --> 16:13.801
<b>You've read my attacks twice now. 
That's the real problem.</b>

16:14.261 --> 16:16.221
<b>I was born in a ninja village,</b>

16:16.221 --> 16:19.551
<b>and I've been perfecting my techniques since childhood.</b>

16:20.891 --> 16:26.101
<b>Yet you saw right through them. 
This I cannot allow.</b>

16:27.231 --> 16:28.851
<b><i>What's he talking about?</i></b>

16:30.061 --> 16:32.441
<b>My pride won't have it.</b>

16:32.441 --> 16:36.661
<b>I don't care who you are, 
but I can't just let you{ simply} walk away.</b>

16:37.491 --> 16:38.951
<b>Oh, come on.</b>

16:39.821 --> 16:42.701
<b>You just want to try out your moves on me.</b>

16:43.241 --> 16:45.541
<b>I can tell by that innocent smile of yours.</b>

16:54.341 --> 16:57.801
<b><i>What do you think of this supersonic speed{that's faster than sound}?</i></b>

16:57.801 --> 16:59.551
<b><i>Of these shock waves?</i></b>

17:00.391 --> 17:01.561
<b><i>Can you even see me?</i></b>

17:05.601 --> 17:08.061
<b><i>How can you possibly keep up with me?</i></b>

17:10.231 --> 17:11.021
<b>Hey…</b>

17:13.521 --> 17:14.781
<b>Can I go home now?</b>

17:16.031 --> 17:17.491
<b><i>Bastard!</i></b>

17:17.491 --> 17:19.241
<b>Wind Blade Kick!</b>

17:23.161 --> 17:24.871
<b>Checkmate.</b>

17:27.701 --> 17:29.581
<b>Sorry!</b>

17:29.581 --> 17:31.831
<b>That wasn't on purpose.</b>

17:31.831 --> 17:35.421
<b>I meant to stop just in time, 
but your momentum made my fist hit your{carried my fist into your}…{original line was incorrect as his momentum carried HIM into his fist not the other way around. i guess this is clear enough}</b>

17:38.181 --> 17:42.681
<b>We are experiencing technical difficulties.</b>

17:38.181 --> 17:42.681
<b>We are experiencing technical difficulties.</b>

17:38.181 --> 17:42.681
<b>Please stand by.</b>

17:38.181 --> 17:42.681
<b>Please stand by.</b>

17:43.301 --> 17:48.351
<b>I've worked every job from assassin 
to bodyguard. No ninja is more deadly.</b>

17:48.351 --> 17:49.691
<b>I am Speed-o'-Sound Sonic!</b>

17:50.141 --> 17:52.561
<b>But I'm putting my work on hold.</b>

17:52.561 --> 17:55.071
<b>Now that I've found such a formidable opponent,</b>

17:55.071 --> 17:57.941
<b>I will dedicate myself to training 
until we settle this.</b>

17:59.321 --> 18:00.901
<b>Tell me your name.</b>

18:01.571 --> 18:02.661
<b>It's Saitama.</b>

18:03.241 --> 18:04.621
<b>Saitama!</b>

18:04.621 --> 18:07.451
<b>Next time we meet, it'll be your demise!</b>

18:10.211 --> 18:11.211
<b>Okay.</b>

18:11.501 --> 18:14.421
<b>I, Speed-o'-Sound Sonic, the ultimate ninja,</b>

18:14.421 --> 18:16.471
<b>will bring you down without fail!</b>

18:17.381 --> 18:18.341
<b>Train hard!</b>

18:21.381 --> 18:23.101
<b>Speed-o'-Sound Sonic?</b>

18:23.101 --> 18:24.431
<b>Who is that?</b>

18:24.431 --> 18:27.181
<b>And who would possess such a redundant name?</b>

18:27.511 --> 18:28.721
<b>Dunno.</b>

18:28.721 --> 18:32.061
<b>He suddenly appeared, 
declared we were rivals, and took off.</b>

18:32.061 --> 18:34.731
<b>If he is a nuisance, I will get rid of him.</b>

