18:45.621 --> 18:50.451
<b>I've learned of a serious problem, 
and it's left me{and am} reeling from shock.</b>

18:50.451 --> 18:52.831
<b>So I beg you, go home for today.</b>

18:52.831 --> 18:54.421
<b>A serious problem?</b>

18:54.961 --> 18:58.511
<b>What could cause a problem 
for someone as great as you?</b>

18:58.511 --> 18:59.471
<b>Please share with me.{cps is more important than keyframes}{is it tho}{also what was with that gap}</b>

19:07.641 --> 19:09.231
<b>No one knows who I am.</b>

19:11.981 --> 19:15.441
<b>It's been three years since I first became a hero.</b>

19:16.191 --> 19:20.941
<b>I've defeated tons of monsters and 
evil organizations since then.</b>

19:20.941 --> 19:25.411
<b>I've never heard of any other heroes doing as much as me.</b>

19:25.411 --> 19:28.751
<b>Everyone in the world should know me by now!</b>

19:28.751 --> 19:32.251
<b>Isn't it weird that I don't have any fans or anything?!</b>

19:32.911 --> 19:35.501
<b>You know what he said to me today?</b>

19:35.921 --> 19:38.761
<b>"Never heard of you."</b>

19:38.761 --> 19:43.131
<b>Plus, everyone in town took me for a terrorist.</b>

19:43.131 --> 19:46.761
<b>They've all forgotten how I beat 
those monsters for them!</b>

19:47.591 --> 19:48.761
<b><i>He is right.</i></b>

19:48.761 --> 19:51.351
<b><i>The news report did not mention</i></b>

19:51.971 --> 19:54.901
<b><i>Master Saitama or Speed-o'-Sound Sonic.</i></b>

19:55.561 --> 19:59.901
<b><i>Instead, the credit for defeating the Paradisers went to a hero called Mumen Rider.</i></b>

20:00.731 --> 20:01.571
<b>Wait…</b>

20:02.321 --> 20:02.821
<b>Master!</b>

20:03.941 --> 20:06.451
